msgid "Choose a full folder path, like C:\\Programs\\Lightify."
msgstr "Elige una ruta de carpeta completa, como C:\\Programs\\Lightify."

#: src/ops.rs:94
msgid "Lightify can't be installed inside the Windows folder."
msgstr "Lightify no se puede instalar dentro de la carpeta de Windows."

#: src/ops.rs:98
msgid "That folder name has characters Windows doesn't allow."
msgstr "Ese nombre de carpeta tiene caracteres que Windows no permite."

